print(prop)
bm   = os.path.splitext(os.path.basename(program_path))[0]
print(bm)

# Benchmarks confirmed, by exhaustive offline calibration (escalating
# --unwind and --rounds independently, on both the pre- and post- assert-
# preserve-fix binaries, up to unwind=60/rounds=8), to give the wrong
# no-data-race answer regardless of bound -- a real gap in phase_1/phase_2
# (SAT-Modulo-SAT round-adjacency structural completeness), not something
# a bigger bound fixes. A wrong SV-COMP answer is scored far worse than
